HUMAN: Round 2 (audio) analysed — spatial SFX, master compressor, subtle throttle-linked prop pitch.
FIND F4 sev=H tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:10562-10598#"function playSfx(event, opts" what="all SFX route flat to audio.master — explosions/gunfire/impacts are full-volume dead-center regardless of world position; no distance attenuation, no pan, no doppler" fix="add playSfx3D(event, worldPos, opts): volume*=1/(1+dist/220) using camera world pos, skip if <0.02; equal-power stereo pan from camera-space x via StereoPannerNode (createStereoPanner, fallback to plain gain if absent); optional opts.radialVel shifts rate ±8% for doppler; wire call sites that already have a world position: explosions 8544/8568, mg-hit 8631, traffic mg 8919, dogfight flyby 8969/9058 — local player weapon fire (8510) and UI cues stay 2D" ref=flight-sim3.html:10585#"src.connect(g).connect(audio.master)",flight-sim3.html:8544#"playSfx('explosion'",flight-sim3.html:8919#"playSfx('mg-burst'" dep=-
FIND F5 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:10864-10893#"audio.master = audio.ctx.createGain" what="master gain feeds destination raw; stacked explosions clip harshly" fix="insert DynamicsCompressorNode between audio.master and destination (threshold -14dB, knee 24, ratio 5, attack 0.004, release 0.18) — glues mix, prevents clip; single node, no per-frame cost" ref=flight-sim3.html:11037-11039#"audio.master.gain.setTargetAtTime" dep=-
FIND F6 sev=M tag=quality at=flight-sim3.html:11045-11049#"const BASE_RATE = 1.14" what="prop sample playback rate is fixed — engine pitch identical at idle and full throttle; reads flat/synthetic" fix="rate = 1.06 + t*0.14 with slow setTargetAtTime tau 0.25 (keeps the deliberate one-clear-voice design: no new layers, no gain bounce — see comment at 11034-11036 explaining why swell/duck was removed; slow tau avoids that artifact); also nudge sampleVol ceiling 0.76->0.80 at full throttle" ref=flight-sim3.html:11041-11056#"if (audio.propSampleReady)" dep=-
OPEN O2 q="doppler on saucers too? their speeds are low; assume traffic planes only" default=traffic-only
DONE stage=F find=3 open=1 tok~=420
